.TH MYGREP 3 "September 2026" "BSDSF24M043-OS-A01" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- find and display lines containing a specified string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B int mygrep(const char *filename, const char *pattern);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mygrep()
function searches the specified file for lines containing the given
.I pattern.
Each matching line is displayed.
The function returns the number of matching lines found.
